{"tuid":"4wd3lyaxi4thp8qi","pageVersion":8,"fetchedAt":"2026-09-30T09:55:56.751Z","record":{"colophon":{"generator":"ifdb.org/viewgame","generatorversion":1,"originated":"2026-04-21"},"identification":{"ifids":["ZCODE-1-980928-29C5","ZCODE-2-981128-A2BB"],"bafn":470,"format":"zcode"},"bibliographic":{"title":"Mother Loose","author":"Irene Callaci","language":"en","firstpublished":"1998","genre":"Literary/Children's","description":"It&#039;s been one of those days. It started out bad and just got worse: You&#039;re seven years old and in trouble a lot. You try to be good and to do as you ought, but nothing, it seems, goes exactly as planned. For instance, today things got quite out of hand: you poured your own milk, but it spilled on the floor; the cat wanted out just as you slammed the door; you didn&#039;t remember to turn off the faucet; your brother, poor thing, is still locked in the closet. But that wasn&#039;t all. No, indeed. Did I mention that things got much worse? They did. Pay attention: you&#039;re lost and alone and nothing&#039;s familiar. You wander around for a while until you&#039;re ready to panic. Then, out of the blue, an egg on a fence asks for help--and from you! <br>[--blurb from The Z-Files Catalogue]"},"contacts":[],"ifdb":{"tuid":"4wd3lyaxi4thp8qi","pageversion":8,"link":"https://ifdb.org/viewgame?id=4wd3lyaxi4thp8qi","coverart":{"url":"https://ifdb.org/coverart?id=4wd3lyaxi4thp8qi&version=8"},"primaryPlayOnlineUrl":"https://iplayif.com/?story=https%3A%2F%2Fifarchive.org%2Fif-archive%2Fgames%2Fzcode%2Floose.z5","downloads":{"links":[{"url":"https://ifarchive.org/if-archive/games/zcode/loose.z5","playOnlineUrl":"https://iplayif.com/?story=https%3A%2F%2Fifarchive.org%2Fif-archive%2Fgames%2Fzcode%2Floose.z5","title":"loose.z5","isGame":true,"format":"zcode"},{"url":"https://ifarchive.org/if-archive/games/competition98/inform/loose/loose.z5","playOnlineUrl":"https://iplayif.com/?story=https%3A%2F%2Fifarchive.org%2Fif-archive%2Fgames%2Fcompetiti